---
title "Install appimagetool"
---

= Install appimagetool

Fetches the continuous `appimagetool-x86_64.AppImage` into `~/.local/bin`. Linux only. Reusable from Scriptbook or `ibex plugins install-tool appimage`.

::: playbook [id="install-appimagetool" shell="bash"]
::: step [id="fetch" confirm=true]
```
if [ "$(uname -s)" != "Linux" ]; then
  echo "appimagetool install playbook is Linux-only." >&2
  exit 1
fi
mkdir -p "$HOME/.local/bin"
url="https://github.com/AppImage/appimagetool/releases/download/continuous/appimagetool-x86_64.AppImage"
dest="$HOME/.local/bin/appimagetool"
if command -v curl >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  curl -fsSL -o "$dest" "$url"
elif command -v wget >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  wget -O "$dest" "$url"
else
  echo "Need curl or wget." >&2
  exit 1
fi
chmod +x "$dest"
echo "Installed $dest"
echo "Ensure ~/.local/bin is on PATH."
```
:::
:::
